{"event_id": 5, "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:56:30.160721+00:00", "run_id": "39d6b85862cf", "method": "direct", "type": "request_end", "request_id": "4e1b88739b3d", "agent_id": 0, "endpoint_index": 0, "stage": "code_propose", "latency_ms": 2131.11, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 255, "completion_tokens": 260, "total_tokens": 515, "estimated": false}, "completion_tokens_charged": 260, "error": null, "response": "```python\ndef min_covering_window(values, required):\n    if not required:\n        return [0, 0]\n\n    need = {}\n    for x in required:\n        need[x] = need.get(x, 0) + 1\n\n    have = {}\n    have_count = 0\n    need_count = len(need)\n\n    best = None\n    best_len = float('inf')\n\n    left = 0\n    for right, val in enumerate(values):\n        if val in need:\n            have[val] = have.get(val, 0) + 1\n            if have[val] == need[val]:\n                have_count += 1\n\n        while have_count == need_count and left <= right:\n            cur_len = right - left + 1\n            if cur_len < best_len or (cur_len == best_len and left < best[0]):\n                best_len = cur_len\n                best = [left, right + 1]\n\n            lv = values[left]\n            if lv in need:\n                if have[lv] == need[lv]:\n                    have_count -= 1\n                have[lv] -= 1\n            left += 1\n\n    return None if best is None else best\n```", "reasoning": null, "finish_reason": "stop", "puzzle_id": "eva-min_covering_window", "node_id": "code-root-eva-min_covering_window", "round": 0}
